Third-party content
-------------------

The parameter descriptions in `spec/effects.toml`, and the tables generated from
them in `docs/midi-spec.md`, are taken from section 9.3 of the DeepMind 12 User
Manual, published by Music Tribe. They are reproduced so that a program can tell
a musician what a parameter does, which is what the protocol data on its own
cannot convey.

Everything else in `spec/` is factual interface data: parameter numbers, byte
offsets, names, ranges, units and value lists. Facts about how a device behaves
are not themselves creative work, and recording them is what makes an
independent implementation possible.

If Music Tribe or Behringer would prefer the descriptions were not reproduced
here, open an issue and they will be removed. Nothing else in this repository
depends on them: they are one optional field, and the library works without it.
